The jet clustering in tiledjet.h is an independent implementation of the anti-kT
/ kT / Cambridge-Aachen sequential recombination algorithms with the tiled
strategy described in M. Cacciari and G. P. Salam, Phys. Lett. B 641 (2006) 57
[hep-ph/0512210] and M. Cacciari, G. P. Salam and G. Soyez, JHEP 04 (2008) 063
[arXiv:0802.1189]. It contains no code from the FastJet package. FastJet
(GPL v2 or later) can be used instead of tiledjet.h as an optional external
dependency; a build that links FastJet is subject to FastJet's licence.

The pileup-per-particle weights in puppi.h are an independent implementation of
the PUPPI algorithm, D. Bertolini, P. Harris, M. Low and N. Tran, JHEP 10 (2014)
059 [arXiv:1407.6013], with the free parameters measured from the weights
stored in CMS NanoAOD as documented in the header. It contains no CMSSW code.

tdrstyle_mod22.C contains the CMS publication-style macros tdrstyle.C and
CMS_lumi.h/.C (CMS Collaboration, https://ghm.web.cern.ch/ghm/plots/), merged
and extended by the author; those parts are not covered by the Apache License
and remain under their original terms.
